{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっはっはくしょんっ\nじゃなくてー\nせーのっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ今回も始まりましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやしゃんblog"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンメントを見て気づいたこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！その前に、\n人形焼きのこと人気焼き！ってかいてたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショック"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、タイトルの文字数の制限についてコメントくれたかた！\n私のは飛鳥みたいにかけません?\n飛鳥のタイトル考えたとき、\nこれどこまでかけんのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってびっくりしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のは、\n入力の上限を越えました！\nこれ以上入力できません。\nってなるんよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、みんなが考えてくれたタイトルを全部使うのは無理っぽい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sorry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、BLT&乃木坂46のコラボTシャツ？ん？ちがう！？\nえっと、まあやがデザインしたTシャツを購入してくださった方が何人かいて、とってもうれすったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って作ったかいがありますよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Thank You\nそして、昨日はそのTシャツにサインを書いたりしたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だれがあたるかなぁ？\n皆さんのことを考えながら作るのは幸せで楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nタンブルじぃじ！\nのこと、かずみさん！って書いてて、\n不思議に思ったかたもいましたね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもダンブルじぃじなんですけど、ダンブルじぃじで、\nわからなかった方が何人か前いたので、\n今回はかずみさんにしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさんにとってもらいやした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪が伸びすぎて気持ちわるいですねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切らなければっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗汗汗\nそして、前髪も長いのー(*_*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、昨日のレッスン中、\n腹がすきすぎたので、\nお腹すいたゲームを\nダブルひなと、あしゅとまあやでしました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひたすら、リズムに合わせて\n今食べたい好きな食べ物を言っていくゲームです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、よけいにお腹空きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを何回もやったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(※ちなみに、あしゅは、苺ミルクを一回も言いませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤は斎藤でも、斉藤ちいちゃんとのツーショットです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、blogのタイトルは引き続き、皆さんが考えてくださったのを使いたいと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も考えてくださったかた\n有り難うございました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、まあやを動物に例えると...の質問にも答えてくれてありがとうございます?\n小動物が多かったですね?\nニヤニヤしながら読みました?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では今から畠中様と約束した集合場所にいき、\n焼き肉を食べにいきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん焼肉は好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎イベント"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日頑張った成果を発揮できたらな！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非遊びに来てねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではお決まりのーーーー\n最後のセリフを\nせーーーのっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいちゃっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃなくって、\nせーーーーーーーーーのっっっっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}